{"id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-martingale.md","title":"Martingale","display":"df-martingale — Martingale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-martingale","aliases":["58-df-martingale","Martingale"],"display":"df-martingale — Martingale","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-filtration.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-martingale</span><span>Martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-martingale — Martingale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54053d8b82e7c72c\" href=\"?note=54053d8b82e7c72c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-filtration.md\">../batch18/58-df-filtration.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,M,\\mathcal F,I\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,M,\\mathcal F,I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（概率空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（离散时间滤过谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"54053d8b82e7c72c\" href=\"?note=54053d8b82e7c72c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-filtration.md\">../batch18/58-df-filtration.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（完全参数化的条件期望谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（此处定义的离散时间鞅谓词；参数顺序为过程、滤过、样本空间、事件代数、概率测度、时间指标）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\nI=\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land M\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(M_n,M_{n+1},\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\nI=\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land M\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(M_n,M_{n+1},\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>六元签名显式保留样本空间、事件代数与概率测度；条件期望关系本身已包含可积性与关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n\">\\(\\mathcal F_n\\)</span> 的可测性。</li>\n<li>旧稿的三元条件期望调用隐藏了必要的环境参数；旧依赖 df-measurable 实际定义的是可测基数，而不是可测函数。</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[M_n]=\\mathbb{E}[M_0]\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[M_n]=\\mathbb{E}[M_0]\\)</span> for each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> for which the expectation is defined.</li>\n<li>Quadratic variation and increasing-process facts are downstream martingale theorems, not part of the definition.</li>\n<li>Martingale: fair game, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] = X_n\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] = X_n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Submartingale: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] \\geq X_n\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] \\geq X_n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Supermartingale: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] \\leq X_n\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] \\leq X_n\\)</span></li>\n<li>对有限时域上的次鞅，Doob 最大不等式的基本形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\,\\mathbb P(\\max_{k\\leq N}M_k\\geq\\lambda)\\leq\\mathbb E[M_N^+]\">\\(\\lambda\\,\\mathbb P(\\max_{k\\leq N}M_k\\geq\\lambda)\\leq\\mathbb E[M_N^+]\\)</span>；原式错误地使用了 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_0^+\">\\(M_0^+\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Williams, Probability with Martingales</li>\n<li>Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-filtration.md","status":"resolved","id":"54053d8b82e7c72c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-filtration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3$（概率空间谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-filtration.md","status":"resolved","id":"54053d8b82e7c72c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2$（离散时间滤过谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-filtration.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6$（完全参数化的条件期望谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,M,\\mathcal F,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\nI=\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land M\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(M_n,M_{n+1},\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[M_n]=\\mathbb{E}[M_0]","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] = X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] \\geq X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[X_{n+1} | \\mathcal{F}_n] \\leq X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\,\\mathbb P(\\max_{k\\leq N}M_k\\geq\\lambda)\\leq\\mathbb E[M_N^+]","display":false},{"tex":"M_0^+","display":false}],"bytes":2446,"backlinks":[{"id":"c87f6cb3f8b7760d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Martingale}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-martingale.md]])"},{"id":"59ee0c08880a79d3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b5795bc870ceffc9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)$ (typed martingale predicate, see [[58-df-martingale]])"},{"id":"8d335d3011844c5a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,(\\mathcal F_n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega)$ (martingale predicate, see [[58-df-martingale]])"},{"id":"f3992ad434a4dd9a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"exc